      "statement": "CompanionScreenCapture maps one clamped, scaled display-local point into two global origins: AppKit bottom-left (Y flipped plus the display's AppKit frame origin) for overlay drawing, and Core Graphics top-left via CGDisplayBounds(displayID) for real CGEvent clicks, avoiding flip-against-primary-screen math that breaks on mixed-resolution multi-monitor layouts; an inverse mapping turns AppKit points (the user's ink) back into screenshot pixels.",
